  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "室內設施維護管理實務與倫理",
    "sub_ename": "INDOOR FACILITIES MAINTENANCE MANAGEMENT PRACTICE AND ETHICS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程從建築生命週期管理的觀點，引導學生從規裝修工程、設備管路、公共設施等層面思考導入修繕、維護、管理等實務課題。以實際個案探討分析，結合工程倫理之概念，培養同學永續的價值觀，並在日後職場與專業倫理發生衝突時所應具備之思考、分析、判斷及解決之能力。",
    "describe_eh": "From the perspective of building life cycle management, this course guides students to think about introducing practical issues such as repair, maintenance, and management from the aspects of decoration engineering, equipment piping, and public facilities. Discuss and analyze the actual case, combine the concept of engineering ethics, cultivate sustainable thinking values of the students, and have the ability to think, analyze, judge and solve in the future conflicts between the workplace and professional ethics.",
